@startuml
title CrisisSync - Activity Diagram 2: SLA Compliance Report Generation & Viewing

|ReportController|
start
if (Generation trigger?) then ([End of calendar month])
  |Scheduler|
  :Trigger automatic monthly\nSLA report generation (REQ-21);
  |ReportController|
  :Determine completed\nreporting month;
else ([On-demand request])
  |System Administrator|
  :Open Reports screen and select\ntarget month (<= 3 actions - REQ-31);
  |ReportController|
  :Verify authenticated\nSystem Administrator role (REQ-30);
  if (Role authorized?) then ([Unauthorized])
    |System Administrator|
    :Display access denied error;
    stop
  else ([Authorized])
    |ReportController|
    if (Selected month has ended?) then ([Current or future month])
      |System Administrator|
      :Display invalid month error\nand prompt for past month (REQ-26);
      stop
    else ([Completed past month])
      |ReportController|
      :Set target reporting month (REQ-25);
    endif
  endif
endif

|ReportController|
:Request event data from database\nfor target reporting month;
if (Database and server available?) then ([Unavailable / Timeout])
  fork
    :Abort generation safely\nand log error details;
  fork again
    :Schedule automatic recovery\n(<= 5 min after DB recovers - REQ-29);
  fork again
    |System Administrator|
    :Display report generation\nfailure alert;
  end fork
  stop
else ([Available])
  |SLAReportController|
  :Select non-cancelled events whose last\ntask closed in reporting month (REQ-24);
  if (Qualifying events exist?) then ([Events found])
    :Compute elapsed duration per event\n(opening to last task closure);
    :Group events by EventType and compute\naverage duration per type (REQ-22, REQ-23);
  else ([No qualifying events])
    :Populate "No data" for each EventType;
  endif
  :Format SLA Compliance Report table\n(<= 30s for up to 10,000 events - REQ-28);

  |ReportController|
  fork
    :Store SLA report with\ngeneration timestamp in DB;
  fork again
    :Publish report to stored\nreports list for viewing;
  end fork

  |System Administrator|
  :Select reporting month and view\nSLA Compliance Report (REQ-27);
  stop
endif
@enduml